Package: adaptation-droidian-salami
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, udev, systemd
Description: Droidian device adaptation for OnePlus 11 (salami)
 Device-specific configuration for the OnePlus 11 (codename: salami),
 based on Qualcomm SM8550 (Snapdragon 8 Gen 2).
 .
 Includes udev rules, partition table, and device properties for
 native Linux boot without an Android Halium container.
